# Google Maps JavaScript API key for the Companies House map (optional).
# Vite inlines VITE_* vars at build time. Copy to `.env.local` for local dev,
# or pass `--build-arg VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=...` to the Docker build.
# The key needs the "Maps JavaScript API" enabled. Without it the map area
# shows a hint instead of a map; search + list still work.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
